  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bugiri Rice Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will be used on value addition and to increase youth rice farmer incomes. The grant will empower farmers with skills and knowledge through training to produce a high volume of rice /output including increases in the quality of trice produced. Grant Activities will also include obtaining and implementing the proper storage systems to allow for collective bulking, earning higher profits and increasing farmer income.</narrative>
  </description>
